        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwiyunge",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Nimwiyunge:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, Nimuvuze induru.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mwa mahanga mwe! Ariko muzavunagurika, kandi namwe abo mu bihugu bya kure nimutege amatwi mwese, mukenyere! Ariko muzavunagurika. Nuko mukenyere ariko muzavunagurika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujye inama, ariko izo nama zizapfa ubusa; nimuvuga n'ijambo ntirizahama: kuko Imana iri kumwe natwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka yamfatishije ukuboko kwe gukomeye, aranyigisha ambwira yuko ntakwiriye kugendera mu migambi y'ubu bwoko ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.14+1PE.3.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3.14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ntimuvuge ngo ‘Baratugambaniye’, nk'uko ubu bwoko buzavuga kuri ibyo byose buti ‘Baratugambaniye.’ Ntimukagire ubwoba nk'ubwabo, kandi ntimugatinye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahubwo Uwiteka Nyiringabo mube ari we mushimisha kwera kwe, kandi uwo abe ari we mujya mwubaha mukamutinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ni we uzababera ubuturo bwera, ariko azabera amazu ya Isirayeli yombi ibuye risitaza n'urutare rugusha, abere n'abaturage b'i Yerusalemu ikigoyi n'umutego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benshi bazamusitaraho bagwe bavunike, bazategwa bafatwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
